	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group_ponytail_batch01","type":"group","x":-2850,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"5","label":"马尾｜真实参考子型"},
		{"id":"group_short_batch01","type":"group","x":-900,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"6","label":"短发｜真实参考子型"},
		{"id":"group_curl_batch01","type":"group","x":1050,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"3","label":"卷发｜真实参考子型"},
		{"id":"group_hime_batch01","type":"group","x":-2850,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"2","label":"公主切｜真实参考子型"},
		{"id":"group_twintail_batch01","type":"group","x":-900,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"1","label":"双马尾｜真实参考子型"},
		{"id":"group_wolf_batch01","type":"group","x":1050,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"5","label":"狼尾／狼剪｜真实参考子型"},
		{"id":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","type":"text","text":"# 女性发型库总表｜真实网络参考子型批次 01（兼容修复版）\n\n**范围：马尾／短发／卷发／公主切／双马尾／狼尾**\n\n原批次使用美发媒体热链，Obsidian 中被防盗链拦截。本版改用 Wikimedia Commons 稳定图片重定向，并保留每张文件页与许可信息。\n\n共 18 张真实网络资料图，不使用生成图冒充参考。","x":-550,"y":-850,"width":1100,"height":460,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"img_ponytail_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 直顺马尾\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Indian%20woman%20in%20ponytail.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Indian%20woman%20in%20ponytail.jpg)","x":-2790,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_ponytail_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 发束包裹马尾\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Hair%20Wrapped%20Ponytail.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hair%20Wrapped%20Ponytail.JPG)","x":-2230,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_ponytail_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 分节马尾\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Sectioned%20Ponytail.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sectioned%20Ponytail.JPG)","x":-1670,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"summary_ponytail_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 马尾结构核验\n\n单束锚点：高度、是否包裹发圈、尾部是否分节。\n\n三张图只作结构对照，角色判断不得依赖模特表情、服装或背景。","x":-2790,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_short_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 经典波波头\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20bob%20haircut.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20bob%20haircut.jpg)","x":-840,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"img_short_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 精灵短发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Pixie%20haircut.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pixie%20haircut.jpg)","x":-280,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"summary_short_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 短发结构核验\n\n长度轮廓：耳上、齐颌、齐颈，以及重量线和层次。\n\n三张图只作结构对照，角色判断不得依赖模特表情、服装或背景。","x":-840,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"img_short_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 长波波头\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20long%20bob%20haircut%20from%20behind.png?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20long%20bob%20haircut%20from%20behind.png)","x":280,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"img_curl_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 自然卷\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Curly%20hair.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Curly%20hair.jpg)","x":1110,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"img_curl_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 大体量卷发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20big%20curly%20hairstyle.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20big%20curly%20hairstyle.jpg)","x":1670,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"img_curl_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 蓬松卷发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Voluminous%20curly%20hairstyle.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Voluminous%20curly%20hairstyle.jpg)","x":2230,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"summary_curl_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 卷发结构核验\n\n纹理层：卷径、起卷位置、规则度与总体蓬松量。\n\n三张图只作结构对照，角色判断不得依赖模特表情、服装或背景。","x":1110,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"img_hime_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 经典公主切\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Hime%20cut.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hime%20cut.jpg)","x":-2790,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"img_hime_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 长侧片公主切\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Cosplayer%20of%20Asuna%20Yuuki%2C%20Sword%20Art%20Online%2020140830.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cosplayer%20of%20Asuna%20Yuuki%2C%20Sword%20Art%20Online%2020140830.jpg)","x":-2230,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"img_hime_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 柔化公主切\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Cosplayer%20of%20Kotori%20Minami%20at%20CWT41%2020151212a.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cosplayer%20of%20Kotori%20Minami%20at%20CWT41%2020151212a.jpg)","x":-1670,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"summary_hime_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 公主切结构核验\n\n剪裁结构：脸侧独立短片与长发主体之间的断层。\n\n三张图只作结构对照，角色判断不得依赖模特表情、服装或背景。","x":-2790,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"img_twintail_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 长双马尾\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/A%20girl%20with%20twin%20tails%3B%20January%202016%20%2804%29.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A%20girl%20with%20twin%20tails%3B%20January%202016%20%2804%29.jpg)","x":-280,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"img_twintail_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 编织双马尾\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Braided%20pigtails.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Braided%20pigtails.jpg)","x":280,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"summary_twintail_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 双马尾结构核验\n\n扎束方式：左右两个主束点，尾部可直、卷或编织。\n\n三张图只作结构对照，角色判断不得依赖模特表情、服装或背景。","x":-840,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"img_wolf_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 狼尾示例\n\n","x":1110,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"audit_batch01","type":"text","text":"# 批次 01 修复审计\n\n- [x] 18 张均来自 Wikimedia Commons 文件页\n- [x] 使用稳定图片重定向，降低防盗链失效\n- [x] 每张保留来源与许可链接\n- [x] 六个家族各 3 张\n- [x] 不使用生成图\n\n若 Obsidian 仍关闭全部远程图片，应再执行‘下载 Commons 图片到仓库 assets，并改为本地 file 节点’。","x":-550,"y":3800,"width":1100,"height":650,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"img_wolf_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 现代狼剪\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20wolfcut%20and%20Foxhound%20jacket%20at%20Tokyo%20Station%20on%20New%20Year%27s%20Eve.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20wolfcut%20and%20Foxhound%20jacket%20at%20Tokyo%20Station%20on%20New%20Year%27s%20Eve.jpg)","x":1670,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"summary_wolf_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 狼尾／狼剪结构核验\n\n层次剪裁：顶部短层、脸周碎层与后颈长尾同时成立。\n\n三张图只作结构对照，角色判断不得依赖模特表情、服装或背景。","x":1110,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_wolf_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 现代鲻鱼近邻\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Modern%20Mullet.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Modern%20Mullet.jpg)","x":2230,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
